# mgsettlr.msg - text of the STAND-IN settler (tests/foundation only, never shipped).
{100}{}{You see a settler who is clearly waiting to be tested.}
{200}{}{New face. Don't touch the bomb, don't drink the puddle, and we'll get along.}
{201}{}{You again. Still haven't touched the bomb, I hope.}
{210}{}{[Test] I did something useful for the town.}
{211}{}{[Test] Here, ten coins for your trouble.}
{212}{}{[Test] Your town smells like a brahmin's regrets.}
{213}{}{[Test] What day is it?}
{214}{}{[Test] Me talk now?}
{215}{}{[Leave]}
{220}{}{Well, look at that. Somebody did something.}
{230}{}{Money. I had forgotten what it looked like.}
{231}{}{You're broke. I know the look. I own a mirror.}
{240}{}{That's it. Stand still.}
{241}{}{[Regret it]}
{250}{}{Same day as yesterday, give or take.}
